IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. MARKS.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 MARK PIC Z99 OCCURS 45 TIMES.
01 NAME PIC X(25) OCCURS 9 TIMES.
01 I PIC 99.
01 J PIC 9.
01 X PIC 99.
01 L PIC 9 VALUE 3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

PERFORM VARYING J FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL J > L
    DISPLAY 'ENTER STUDENT ' J ' NAME: ' WITH NO ADVANCING
    ACCEPT NAME(J)
    
    COMPUTE X = (J - 1) * 5 + 1

    PERFORM VARYING I FROM X BY 1 UNTIL I > (X + 4)
        DISPLAY 'ENTER MARKS OF SUBJECT ' I ': ' WITH NO ADVANCING
        ACCEPT MARK(I)
    END-PERFORM
END-PERFORM

DISPLAY 'NAME                        1   2   3   4   5'

PERFORM VARYING J FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL J > L

    DISPLAY NAME(J) WITH NO ADVANCING
    COMPUTE X = (J - 1) * 5 + 1

    PERFORM VARYING I FROM X BY 1 UNTIL I > (X + 4)
        DISPLAY ' ' MARK(I) WITH NO ADVANCING
    END-PERFORM
    DISPLAY SPACE
END-PERFORM
STOP RUN.
